<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-SOCCER CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-SOCCER CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the fifth round of the</p>
<p>Estonian soccer championship matches on Monday:</p>
<p>    Tallinna Sadam    4  Narva Trans     0</p>
<p>The results of games played over the weekend:</p>
<p>    Viljandi Tulevik  2  Lelle Sk	  1</p>
<p>    Lantana	     1  Johvi	     1</p>
<p>    TVMK		  1  FC Flora	  2</p>
<p>		 </p>
<p>Standings (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p>				   P  W  D  L   F  A  PTS</p>
<p>    Narva Trans		5  3  1  1   6  7  10</p>
<p>    FC Flora		   4  3  0  1  14  3   9</p>
<p>    Tallinna Sadam	   5  2  3  0  15  6   9</p>
<p>    Viljandi Tulevik	 5  2  2  1   8  7   8</p>
<p>    FC Lantana		 4  1  3  0   6  4   6</p>
<p>    TVMK			 5  1  2  2   5  7   5</p>
<p>    Johvi EP		   5  0  3  2   4  9   3</p>
